  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6fe17a2d439d18459e035bb2968ecb3, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'If you want someone to take the opposite direction, you can tell
    them to turn right.

    In Ilokano, ''agliko iti kannawan'' means ''turn right.''

    Now,
    try saying ''agliko iti kannawan'' yourself.'
